1
00:01:56,143 --> 00:02:03,303
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:03,675 --> 00:02:08,455
No living creature was hurt during
the production of this show.

3
00:02:12,307 --> 00:02:16,897
The hostility which is getting worse
between two Beys...

4
00:02:17,001 --> 00:02:18,831
needs to end.

5
00:02:19,055 --> 00:02:21,625
The solution is clear.

6
00:02:21,865 --> 00:02:24,255
It is to marry their daughter.

7
00:02:27,486 --> 00:02:31,886
What I want from you is to marry
Malhun Hatun.

8
00:02:33,779 --> 00:02:35,209
My Sheik...

9
00:02:37,123 --> 00:02:39,443
I am already married.

10
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:42,580
It's your daughter.

11
00:02:45,203 --> 00:02:48,633
She can't give birth.

12
00:02:53,421 --> 00:03:00,021
You have to have a son in order for
Kayı Tribe to have a future.

13
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:06,000
You can't postpone it any further.

14
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:32,760
Do you see how they're looking at you?

15
00:03:33,427 --> 00:03:36,797
They trust you, they believe in you.

16
00:03:37,583 --> 00:03:41,793
You are responsible for them, Osman Bey.

17
00:03:42,407 --> 00:03:45,851
You have to show your heir to them by...

18
00:03:45,851 --> 00:03:50,541
marrying a Bey's daughter who will
enrich your tribe.

19
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:54,090
I know, my Sheik.
I know.

20
00:03:54,178 --> 00:03:56,708
But how can I do this to Bala?

21
00:03:58,266 --> 00:04:01,416
Bala knows what's going to happen.

22
00:04:02,887 --> 00:04:04,737
But...

23
00:04:08,306 --> 00:04:13,116
Malhun Hatun would hurt her, my Sheik.

24
00:04:22,881 --> 00:04:24,811
Think about it.

25
00:04:26,146 --> 00:04:29,876
Let me know when you decide.

26
00:04:31,673 --> 00:04:36,223
I have no doubt that you'll
decide on the best.

27
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:04,689
Let's go Kumral Abdal.
We are done here.

28
00:05:04,689 --> 00:05:06,839
Off we go, my Sheik.

29
00:05:29,913 --> 00:05:31,373
Alps.

30
00:05:33,908 --> 00:05:36,118
We are returning to the tent.

31
00:06:21,212 --> 00:06:24,442
- Umur Bey is absent.
- What do you mean?

32
00:06:24,469 --> 00:06:26,694
He is absent, Nicola!

33
00:06:26,764 --> 00:06:31,994
There is nothing but crows where
he and his Alps should be.

34
00:06:41,308 --> 00:06:44,689
Sir, Togay is coming with his soldiers.

35
00:06:44,689 --> 00:06:47,188
- What are we going to do Nicola?
- Shut up.

36
00:06:47,188 --> 00:06:51,084
They don't know we're here.
We can have a sudden arrow attack.

37
00:06:51,084 --> 00:06:55,964
I told you to shut up! We lost
Bitinya because of fools like you!

38
00:06:56,011 --> 00:07:00,393
We can't defeat Togay with a bunch of
soldiers we have!

39
00:07:00,393 --> 00:07:01,983
Sir, they are coming!

40
00:07:33,118 --> 00:07:36,028
What are we going to do Nicola?

41
00:07:45,950 --> 00:07:49,630
Go back to your castle.
Pay your tax.

42
00:07:50,431 --> 00:07:53,841
- I can't do it.
- I told you to do it.

43
00:07:54,224 --> 00:07:56,374
You'll do it!

44
00:07:57,094 --> 00:08:00,254
Let Togay think he dominates us.

45
00:08:01,159 --> 00:08:04,699
Patience.
A little bit more patience.

46
00:08:05,495 --> 00:08:09,535
Damn patience.

47
00:08:09,851 --> 00:08:13,711
Go back to your castle.
We're returning to castle!

48
00:08:20,747 --> 00:08:23,057
We are returning to castle!

49
00:08:49,128 --> 00:08:55,048
The hostility which is getting worse
between two Beys needs to end.

50
00:08:55,338 --> 00:08:58,558
The solution is clear.

51
00:08:58,743 --> 00:09:01,493
It is to marry their daughter.

52
00:09:23,564 --> 00:09:25,454
He hampers my trade!

53
00:09:27,115 --> 00:09:31,025
He stops me from fighting against
my biggest enemy!

54
00:09:31,959 --> 00:09:34,269
Osman Bey crossed the line!

55
00:09:34,392 --> 00:09:38,002
How much longer is he going to
fade out my tribe's future?

56
00:09:41,722 --> 00:09:43,702
If he didn't stop me...

57
00:09:43,817 --> 00:09:46,097
He shouldn't have stopped me!

58
00:09:47,176 --> 00:09:49,736
If Edebalı hadn't stopped me...

59
00:09:51,245 --> 00:09:57,555
I missed the opportunity to take revenge,
to cut that dog's throat!

60
00:09:57,901 --> 00:10:01,187
Do you see what Osman Bey who you
support all the time does?

61
00:10:01,187 --> 00:10:05,757
Do you see how he stops my rise in the
eyes of other Turkmen Beys?

62
00:10:07,704 --> 00:10:10,714
Are we going to trust this man
about future?

63
00:10:11,385 --> 00:10:16,121
My Bey, Osman Bey's intention was not
to stop your rise.

64
00:10:16,121 --> 00:10:17,411
Then what?

65
00:10:22,277 --> 00:10:25,337
He wanted to make himself clear.

66
00:10:25,337 --> 00:10:28,617
He told us everything.
He made an agreement with Seljuq...

67
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:30,340
Enough!

68
00:10:39,313 --> 00:10:41,833
I'll go back to my tent if you allow.

69
00:10:41,933 --> 00:10:45,023
I shall come back when you are
ready to hear the truth.

70
00:10:50,852 --> 00:10:52,482
Malhun!

71
00:10:56,407 --> 00:11:00,977
I take back every Alp I gave in
your order!

72
00:11:04,197 --> 00:11:07,557
You'll have no say in any of my business
from now on.

73
00:11:08,604 --> 00:11:11,114
I'll manage Alps.

74
00:11:11,207 --> 00:11:16,197
You'll sit in your tent just like
other tribes' Hatuns.

75
00:11:18,689 --> 00:11:20,679
Now you can go!

76
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:06,310
Spring is coming my Sheik.

77
00:12:11,260 --> 00:12:14,380
My Lord is scattering his ornaments
to the ground.

78
00:12:26,867 --> 00:12:32,307
Insha Allah the hostility between
Umur Bey and Osman Bey ends...

79
00:12:32,765 --> 00:12:35,405
and spring visits Turkmen tribes too,
my Sheik.

80
00:12:42,259 --> 00:12:46,829
Does spring come without
trees getting rid of their secrets?

81
00:12:47,814 --> 00:12:50,524
Does flowers bloom, Kumral Abdal?

82
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:58,599
My Osman Bey has to do the difficult.

83
00:12:59,671 --> 00:13:04,891
He needs to get rid of his secret and
let the flower in his heart bloom.

84
00:13:08,469 --> 00:13:13,739
Obviously, he is afraid of hurting
his flower, my Sheik.

85
00:13:14,517 --> 00:13:20,157
Spring doesn't come if
you don't get cold, Kumral Abdal.

86
00:13:23,282 --> 00:13:28,095
Both my beloved Bala and
Osman Bey...

87
00:13:28,095 --> 00:13:30,135
are going through hard times.

88
00:13:32,885 --> 00:13:37,035
They are going to be patient.
They are going to be hurt.

89
00:13:37,095 --> 00:13:39,475
Then they're going to heal.

90
00:13:41,284 --> 00:13:43,614
This is the only way.

91
00:14:06,896 --> 00:14:09,806
As I have no one else other
than you in my heart...

92
00:14:10,809 --> 00:14:13,899
I have no intention to look for
someone else other than you, Bala.

93
00:14:15,966 --> 00:14:20,886
You are my prayer.
You shall be with me.

94
00:14:22,509 --> 00:14:25,189
Having children is Allah's decision.

95
00:14:33,304 --> 00:14:36,035
How can a little dagger wound
seperate us...

96
00:14:36,035 --> 00:14:40,115
while we are in so much
love with each other, my Bala?

97
00:14:51,546 --> 00:14:52,896
Bala.

98
00:14:53,913 --> 00:14:55,683
Sit.

99
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,930
Sit.

100
00:15:02,101 --> 00:15:04,141
Since when have you been here, my Bey?

101
00:15:09,057 --> 00:15:11,007
I was watching you.

102
00:15:16,433 --> 00:15:18,123
What were you thinking about?

103
00:15:20,582 --> 00:15:22,282
My Sheik father...

104
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:25,190
didn't let me go to you at once.

105
00:15:27,804 --> 00:15:30,214
He said no first.

106
00:15:32,973 --> 00:15:37,913
I was daydreaming, watching
the candles...

107
00:15:38,578 --> 00:15:40,538
in the Dergah(where Dervishes live).

108
00:15:42,230 --> 00:15:46,890
I couldn't tell if the fire is in
the candle or in my heart.

109
00:16:02,115 --> 00:16:03,505
So...

110
00:16:04,946 --> 00:16:07,306
what do you feel now?

111
00:16:12,319 --> 00:16:14,719
You are my candle now.

112
00:16:16,623 --> 00:16:19,763
And I am a fan in your fire.

113
00:16:56,330 --> 00:16:58,210
Finally...

114
00:16:58,947 --> 00:17:02,227
you bow to me, Nicola.

115
00:17:03,273 --> 00:17:05,453
What about Osman Bey's tax?

116
00:17:07,151 --> 00:17:10,050
Osman Bey will pay to Sultan.

117
00:17:10,703 --> 00:17:16,713
He thinks he can hide his taxes
in Turkmen Beys' eyes.

118
00:17:17,712 --> 00:17:21,152
This doesn't matter after obeying
persians.

119
00:17:22,546 --> 00:17:29,888
You sweared
on Cenghiz Khan's life to kill Osman...

120
00:17:29,888 --> 00:17:32,822
I am afraid that you make the
souls angry, Togay!

121
00:17:33,633 --> 00:17:38,803
My swear will not end until this land...

122
00:17:38,847 --> 00:17:41,487
becomes grave to...

123
00:17:42,094 --> 00:17:46,214
one of us, and until one of us
is sacrificed to the souls, Camu!

124
00:17:47,929 --> 00:17:52,229
Only blood can save us from the
wrath of souls!

125
00:17:52,975 --> 00:18:01,225
Osman will send messenger.
He'll announce he obeys us one more time.

126
00:18:02,138 --> 00:18:03,768
Be patient.

127
00:18:03,967 --> 00:18:05,917
Go now.

128
00:18:35,072 --> 00:18:38,519
You'll have no say in any of my business
from now on.

129
00:18:38,519 --> 00:18:40,889
I'll manage Alps.

130
00:18:41,013 --> 00:18:45,983
You'll sit in your tent just like
other tribes' Hatuns.

131
00:18:51,424 --> 00:18:54,024
Will I sit in my tent?

132
00:18:55,922 --> 00:18:57,872
Can I come in?

133
00:19:00,596 --> 00:19:02,626
Come.

134
00:19:12,173 --> 00:19:13,983
What do you say, Alaca Hatun?

135
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:18,670
What should I do with this sword?

136
00:19:19,710 --> 00:19:21,750
Now that I am not fighting...

137
00:19:23,093 --> 00:19:26,053
I am not going to be honored
by the holiness of war...

138
00:19:29,608 --> 00:19:33,508
Should I melt it in the fire and make
jewellery out of its steel?

139
00:19:38,469 --> 00:19:42,699
Or should I sell it to a junk dealer?

140
00:19:42,699 --> 00:19:44,439
Don't talk like that!

141
00:19:45,029 --> 00:19:47,819
It's the sharpest sword of
Kızılbeyoğulları.

142
00:19:48,730 --> 00:19:52,800
Don't worry.
Your father will change his mind.

143
00:19:57,485 --> 00:19:59,067
How are my Alps doing?

144
00:19:59,067 --> 00:20:03,927
They don't want to retreat.
They want to fight under you.

145
00:20:04,444 --> 00:20:07,574
They want you to know that they
are under your dominance.

146
00:20:12,908 --> 00:20:16,268
Tell them to be ready.
I'll talk to them.

147
00:20:30,544 --> 00:20:32,454
Elhamdulillah. (Thanks to Allah)

148
00:20:33,738 --> 00:20:35,638
Thank you, Bala Hatun.

149
00:20:36,101 --> 00:20:39,791
We haven't had such a feast
for a while.

150
00:20:41,628 --> 00:20:44,428
Boran Alps keeps talking about it.

151
00:20:44,682 --> 00:20:48,892
I can't cook game meat
as well as Bala.

152
00:20:49,532 --> 00:20:51,242
Enjoy your meal.

153
00:20:51,751 --> 00:20:55,491
I learned it from Akca and Dervishes
in Dergah (where dervishes live).

154
00:21:03,490 --> 00:21:07,270
My Osman, you haven't hunted
for some time.

155
00:21:09,822 --> 00:21:12,302
Doesn't infidels count, my Bala?

156
00:21:23,738 --> 00:21:26,218
What did you think of, my Bey?

157
00:21:30,585 --> 00:21:34,115
When I was this little...

158
00:21:35,536 --> 00:21:38,156
We went hunting with my father one day.

159
00:21:38,499 --> 00:21:43,189
But it was my first time
hunting on horse.

160
00:21:43,284 --> 00:21:46,976
Then my father started explaining.

161
00:21:46,976 --> 00:21:49,846
He said, "you'll get up on horse...

162
00:21:49,924 --> 00:21:53,183
you'll grasp the horse with your feet...

163
00:21:53,183 --> 00:21:58,173
then you're going to focus on your prey...

164
00:21:58,878 --> 00:22:04,328
then you'll speed up, speed up...

165
00:22:05,457 --> 00:22:11,387
you'll raise your arrow, stretch
your bow, shoot your prey."

166
00:22:14,996 --> 00:22:20,776
We found the gazalle.
My father went after it.

167
00:22:22,191 --> 00:22:24,531
He did it like he explained.

168
00:22:25,227 --> 00:22:29,647
Then told me that it was my turn.

169
00:22:30,203 --> 00:22:32,683
He also told me that
this skill required experience.

170
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:39,429
Then we went through forests
and rivers...

171
00:22:39,517 --> 00:22:42,137
We arrived at a huge valley.

172
00:22:42,481 --> 00:22:44,751
We followed the gazelle so far.

173
00:22:46,244 --> 00:22:50,034
Then I focused, prepared my arrow...

174
00:22:50,471 --> 00:22:54,101
stretched my bow, and taaak,
I shot it.

175
00:22:58,352 --> 00:23:00,290
My father was surprised.

176
00:23:00,290 --> 00:23:01,960
He said "you did it."

177
00:23:03,553 --> 00:23:09,493
And I replied "yes father, you showed me,
I shot." That's what I said.

178
00:23:11,874 --> 00:23:15,553
My father told this to my brothers
all the night over and over.

179
00:23:15,553 --> 00:23:18,163
"You showed me, I shot."

180
00:23:19,058 --> 00:23:21,228
"You showed me, I shot."

181
00:23:22,544 --> 00:23:25,284
Good old days.

182
00:23:29,477 --> 00:23:32,597
He didn't expect you to shot
it in your first time, my Bey.

183
00:23:33,019 --> 00:23:37,739
To be honest, I haven't heard something
like that too. Masha Allah (praise be).

184
00:23:39,890 --> 00:23:44,100
Ertugrul Ghazi was proud so much of you,
my Bey.

185
00:23:45,721 --> 00:23:51,151
Of course he did, my Gonca. My Bey will be
proud of his children when he has.

186
00:24:25,727 --> 00:24:30,527
Eeh, my Bey. You must have missed hunting,
we can do it, huh?

187
00:24:34,593 --> 00:24:38,093
Yes, yes we shall go hunting.

188
00:24:38,140 --> 00:24:40,860
We'll go right away.
We'll go tomorrow.

189
00:24:42,131 --> 00:24:43,751
We'll go tomorrow.

190
00:24:49,141 --> 00:24:51,441
I'll take sherbet.

191
00:24:52,204 --> 00:24:54,244
I'll help you Bala.

192
00:25:11,201 --> 00:25:13,981
My Bey, forgive me.

193
00:25:14,504 --> 00:25:16,834
I couldn't figure my words.

194
00:25:37,544 --> 00:25:39,054
My Bala...

195
00:25:39,254 --> 00:25:41,794
I apologize for Boran Alp.

196
00:25:42,482 --> 00:25:45,892
He had no bad intention.

197
00:25:48,532 --> 00:25:53,782
There's nothing to apologize for, my
Gonca. Boran Alp said nothing wrong.

198
00:25:53,906 --> 00:25:56,386
Every father is proud of their children.

199
00:25:57,053 --> 00:25:59,293
And my Osman Bey can't be a father...

200
00:26:11,914 --> 00:26:13,934
I paid my tax to Togay.

201
00:26:14,156 --> 00:26:15,836
What did he say?

202
00:26:16,047 --> 00:26:21,001
He thinks he is the only governor
in Bitinya.

203
00:26:21,001 --> 00:26:22,771
Only Bitinya?

204
00:26:22,771 --> 00:26:28,071
That dog thinks he is the only
governor in the whole world!

205
00:26:28,261 --> 00:26:32,641
He said Osman obeyed Mongols
after Konya visit.

206
00:26:34,730 --> 00:26:36,600
Is that so?

207
00:26:38,969 --> 00:26:42,179
Osman must have convinced Sultan.

208
00:26:43,215 --> 00:26:47,982
What Sultan wants is to
protect his position.

209
00:26:47,982 --> 00:26:51,423
Geyhatu is like a bankrupting merchant.

210
00:26:51,423 --> 00:26:57,097
They both need gold to save their
positions. They don't care about Osman.

211
00:26:57,097 --> 00:27:00,415
The only thing they want is gold.

212
00:27:00,415 --> 00:27:03,700
Are we going to pay tax until
we go dry?

213
00:27:03,700 --> 00:27:06,390
For how long will this go on, Nicola?

214
00:27:11,925 --> 00:27:15,905
If Togay and Osman are in peace...

215
00:27:16,046 --> 00:27:19,876
we have to destroy that peace.

216
00:27:20,632 --> 00:27:24,152
We should set them against
each other, right, Yason?

217
00:27:24,721 --> 00:27:26,731
How will you do that?

218
00:27:27,048 --> 00:27:28,848
Umur Bey.

219
00:27:29,884 --> 00:27:34,044
We'll wait for the coward who even
couldn't...

220
00:27:34,590 --> 00:27:37,200
come to the trap we set for him.

221
00:27:38,302 --> 00:27:39,922
Is that right?

222
00:27:40,213 --> 00:27:43,253
Osman must have stopped him.

223
00:27:44,026 --> 00:27:48,206
But this won't turn off the hatred
in Umur Bey against Togay.

224
00:27:48,816 --> 00:27:54,616
Umur will come to me sooner or later.

225
00:27:55,820 --> 00:28:00,150
How will you set Osman and Togay
against each other?

226
00:28:02,464 --> 00:28:08,524
Whether he accepts or not,
Umur is under Osman's umbrealla

227
00:28:08,669 --> 00:28:15,950
For how long do you think a honorable and
stubborn Bey like him can put up with Osman?

228
00:28:26,498 --> 00:28:28,578
Here another question, Yason.

229
00:28:28,604 --> 00:28:33,284
In a scenario in which Umur attacks Togay,
what happens?

230
00:28:36,539 --> 00:28:41,369
As Umur is under Osman's patronage...

231
00:28:41,452 --> 00:28:46,392
Osman would be responsible
for this attack.

232
00:28:46,518 --> 00:28:47,708
Well done.

233
00:28:49,057 --> 00:28:50,247
So...

234
00:28:53,707 --> 00:28:56,937
Whom will Togay hit at?

235
00:28:58,032 --> 00:29:00,712
- At Osman.
- At Osman.

236
00:29:03,125 --> 00:29:08,945
Peace coming from gold
melts by blood.

237
00:29:09,256 --> 00:29:13,876
Even Mongol's puppet Sultan Mesut
can't save Osman now.

238
00:29:15,458 --> 00:29:17,848
Bring me wine!

239
00:29:19,320 --> 00:29:23,800
I'll be patient and wait now.

240
00:29:24,720 --> 00:29:30,230
I'll wait for Umur to come to me.

241
00:29:33,385 --> 00:29:36,815
You go back to your castle.
Wait for my order.

242
00:29:58,063 --> 00:30:01,323
My Bey will be proud of his children
when he has.

243
00:30:13,944 --> 00:30:15,994
My Bey.

244
00:30:24,381 --> 00:30:26,981
Why are you upset?

245
00:30:27,321 --> 00:30:30,501
It's all because of me that
you don't have a child.

246
00:30:31,260 --> 00:30:35,800
If you don't have a heir, it's because
your Hatun can't give birth.

247
00:30:39,359 --> 00:30:45,509
I saw how your eyes were smiling while
talking about your father Ertugrul Ghazi.

248
00:30:47,192 --> 00:30:51,492
Being a father,
having a heir is your right.

249
00:30:52,842 --> 00:30:55,242
Even it is your duty.

250
00:31:08,755 --> 00:31:11,545
My father's bequest is in my memory.

251
00:31:14,253 --> 00:31:17,133
I remember it.

252
00:31:20,297 --> 00:31:25,057
You...
You...

253
00:31:27,925 --> 00:31:30,645
You shall not hurt yourself...

254
00:31:32,516 --> 00:31:35,836
by thinking these, my Bala.

255
00:31:38,575 --> 00:31:41,015
Don't think about it.

256
00:31:41,339 --> 00:31:45,679
Everything will be what they'll be.

257
00:31:49,193 --> 00:31:52,113
I know you're going to decide on the best.

258
00:31:52,716 --> 00:31:57,086
You're thinking about a Hatun that
would hurt Bala least.

259
00:31:58,157 --> 00:32:01,157
This is why your decision is late.

260
00:32:02,028 --> 00:32:03,998
I know it.

261
00:32:06,388 --> 00:32:08,688
But I am okay with this.

262
00:32:09,592 --> 00:32:11,882
I am okay with my fate.

263
00:32:12,072 --> 00:32:14,372
You should know that.

264
00:33:13,536 --> 00:33:20,676
We agreed on a decision with Sultan
about Togay issue in Konya.

265
00:33:21,971 --> 00:33:28,651
Now it's time to send a messenger to
Togay.

266
00:33:31,163 --> 00:33:34,563
I appoint Goktug for this mission.

267
00:33:34,936 --> 00:33:37,036
I am at your service my Bey.

268
00:33:38,014 --> 00:33:42,826
My Bey, we prepared accommodation
for refrugees as you ordered.

269
00:33:42,826 --> 00:33:45,486
Eyvallah, but that issue is not done yet.

270
00:33:45,632 --> 00:33:48,222
Help them settle.

271
00:33:48,402 --> 00:33:52,382
Take care of their needs.

272
00:33:52,574 --> 00:33:54,354
Yes my Bey.

273
00:34:06,560 --> 00:34:11,210
My Beys, I have to consult you...

274
00:34:11,965 --> 00:34:14,875
about an important subject.

275
00:34:18,078 --> 00:34:21,708
Tell us Osman Bey.
We are listening.

276
00:34:24,563 --> 00:34:30,634
This may seem a personal subject,
but it actually interests Kayı's future.

277
00:34:35,697 --> 00:34:40,518
You know about our continual
problems with Umur Bey.

278
00:34:41,987 --> 00:34:47,138
Sheik Edebalı think that I have to
marry Malhun Hatun...

279
00:34:49,275 --> 00:34:55,525
in order these problems to end.

280
00:35:03,544 --> 00:35:06,934
This will be a political marriage.

281
00:35:09,334 --> 00:35:11,694
I wanted to hear your opinions.

282
00:35:13,598 --> 00:35:16,977
Eyvallah, Eyvallah Osman Bey.

283
00:35:16,977 --> 00:35:21,910
If this marriage will make Umur Bey
stand with us...

284
00:35:21,910 --> 00:35:26,340
it surely is good.

285
00:35:27,872 --> 00:35:33,532
Malhun Hatun is proper for you, and
she is noble.

286
00:35:38,014 --> 00:35:42,577
But, Osman Bey, this is
easy to tell for us...

287
00:35:42,577 --> 00:35:46,047
but it's hard to do it for you.

288
00:35:51,167 --> 00:35:55,107
Malhun Hatun has been on your side
all the time, Osman Bey.

289
00:35:56,141 --> 00:36:00,815
She supported you
when we had aid from Inegol...

290
00:36:00,815 --> 00:36:04,135
and she even fought on your side
in the war.

291
00:36:07,717 --> 00:36:11,377
Now that you need a heir...

292
00:36:12,253 --> 00:36:16,783
That heir's mother should be noble and
valiant...

293
00:36:16,819 --> 00:36:20,029
as his father.

294
00:36:23,744 --> 00:36:25,654
And this is Fard.

295
00:36:29,318 --> 00:36:31,798
This will be between us for now.

296
00:36:37,683 --> 00:36:41,073
Of course it will be.

297
00:36:42,102 --> 00:36:48,532
Osman Bey, what I see is that
you know what's going to happen.

298
00:36:49,380 --> 00:36:55,570
But I also see that you are worried
about Bala Hatun.

299
00:36:58,405 --> 00:37:02,775
Osman Bey, postponing it won't help
you.

300
00:37:02,826 --> 00:37:07,196
You shall tell her as soon as possible.

301
00:37:08,055 --> 00:37:13,365
I'll have decided when I return from
hunting, Bamsı Bey.

302
00:37:14,509 --> 00:37:17,859
Eyvallah, I wish the best for us.

303
00:37:18,599 --> 00:37:20,029
Amen.

304
00:37:49,468 --> 00:37:52,108
As Alaca Hatun said...

305
00:37:53,361 --> 00:37:57,811
There are alps who would disobey
Umur Bey for me.

306
00:38:01,052 --> 00:38:03,922
And they are a lot in number.

307
00:38:04,054 --> 00:38:06,034
- Is that true, Rasid?
- Yes it is.

308
00:38:06,440 --> 00:38:09,220
We have been at your service
for as long as we can remember.

309
00:38:14,232 --> 00:38:19,052
At my service, under Umur Bey's flag.

310
00:38:23,013 --> 00:38:26,629
Tell me, who are with me?

311
00:38:26,629 --> 00:38:28,319
I want to see.

312
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:40,679
You supported us in every mistake we made.
You healed some of us...

313
00:38:40,679 --> 00:38:43,679
you helped some of us to marry.

314
00:38:44,039 --> 00:38:46,369
We are with you.

315
00:38:48,551 --> 00:38:51,901
You remember the goodness, yes.

316
00:38:54,047 --> 00:38:59,127
We are the steel swords waiting for you
to command us, Malhun Hatun.

317
00:39:02,183 --> 00:39:06,143
Steel swords waiting for me to command
you, huh?

318
00:39:15,205 --> 00:39:18,375
What can I do with a stupid sword, huh?

319
00:39:19,834 --> 00:39:23,334
What shall I do with a sword that
raises against his Bey?

320
00:39:25,353 --> 00:39:26,473
Malhun Hatun.

321
00:39:26,493 --> 00:39:30,953
Alps!
Look around Alps!

322
00:39:32,888 --> 00:39:37,838
You are in Umur Bey's land!
Pull yourselves together!

323
00:39:40,191 --> 00:39:45,731
This tent's Bey is Umur Bey.
No one can disobey him!

324
00:39:45,751 --> 00:39:47,861
You shall sink that in!

325
00:39:50,377 --> 00:39:54,337
If anyone is to disobey Umur Bey...

326
00:39:54,371 --> 00:39:57,871
He'll face my sword first!

327
00:40:19,595 --> 00:40:21,405
Dark Osman.

328
00:40:24,012 --> 00:40:25,732
Dark Osman.

329
00:40:26,518 --> 00:40:28,508
What, Kumral Abdal?

330
00:40:30,500 --> 00:40:32,450
What are you looking at?

331
00:40:32,662 --> 00:40:36,912
Is there anyone other than me
who calls you Dark Osman?

332
00:40:38,512 --> 00:40:41,442
Yes, there isn't.

333
00:40:43,521 --> 00:40:46,791
Tell me.
Why are you calling me that?

334
00:40:47,246 --> 00:40:49,136
Tell me.

335
00:40:53,202 --> 00:40:55,102
I heard you are going hunting.

336
00:40:57,884 --> 00:40:59,454
Yes.

337
00:41:05,046 --> 00:41:08,576
- The mountains missed me.
- Yes.

338
00:41:11,037 --> 00:41:16,587
Me either. I missed the sound of the
forests and shadows of the mountains.

339
00:41:17,232 --> 00:41:21,042
Tell me I can come too.
Come on, say that.

340
00:41:32,868 --> 00:41:35,848
Come on.
Okay, then.

341
00:41:36,221 --> 00:41:37,711
You can come with us too.

342
00:41:38,945 --> 00:41:41,665
Don't let these mountains be alone.

343
00:41:44,072 --> 00:41:46,392
Yes!

344
00:42:36,373 --> 00:42:38,813
You!
A disgrace!

345
00:42:39,217 --> 00:42:40,567
Traitor!

346
00:43:00,998 --> 00:43:02,878
Stop!

347
00:43:29,949 --> 00:43:32,049
Cerkutay.

348
00:43:34,740 --> 00:43:36,290
Look at you.

349
00:43:40,335 --> 00:43:43,455
You betrayed the rules of Genghis Khan.

350
00:43:44,750 --> 00:43:47,510
Turks enslaved you.

351
00:43:57,718 --> 00:44:01,738
Cerkutay obeys Allah's rules.

352
00:44:04,671 --> 00:44:06,591
Camuka.

353
00:44:11,179 --> 00:44:13,839
We are here as Osman Bey's messengers.

354
00:44:15,727 --> 00:44:17,797
Search him.

355
00:44:26,453 --> 00:44:31,053
We are not traitors like
your messenger, Camuka

356
00:44:31,233 --> 00:44:34,433
Shut up.
Follow me.

357
00:44:38,753 --> 00:44:40,103
Brothers.

358
00:44:40,161 --> 00:44:42,311
You will stay here.

359
00:45:18,979 --> 00:45:24,629
Seljuqs will pay Osman Bey's golds
with the order of Seljuqs Sultan.

360
00:45:25,572 --> 00:45:26,932
Osman.

361
00:45:28,248 --> 00:45:30,888
He finally found the right way.

362
00:45:33,879 --> 00:45:35,909
We don't care from where it is coming...

363
00:45:36,899 --> 00:45:39,479
if we will get gold.

364
00:45:39,744 --> 00:45:42,674
Whether it is from Osman Bey or...

365
00:45:43,385 --> 00:45:47,675
from Sultan.

366
00:45:48,396 --> 00:45:54,656
We will get your golds until
we get run off your feet.

367
00:45:55,254 --> 00:45:59,444
Every breath you take is tied to the
golds you will give.

368
00:46:00,434 --> 00:46:05,934
As Osman Bey is tied to Geyhatu and me.

369
00:46:07,336 --> 00:46:11,566
Osman Bey wants you to know
that we stick to our deal.

370
00:46:12,769 --> 00:46:14,689
Tell Osman Bey...

371
00:46:15,421 --> 00:46:18,371
if he wants to live in these lands...

372
00:46:19,844 --> 00:46:22,544
he will be tied to us.

373
00:46:24,436 --> 00:46:31,006
My anger and the shadow of my sword
will be his death warrant.

374
00:46:32,044 --> 00:46:34,584
He shouldn't forget that.

375
00:46:35,077 --> 00:46:38,437
Now go and tell Osman Bey that...

376
00:46:38,592 --> 00:46:43,172
Dark Shaman Togay sticks
to the deal as well.

377
00:46:53,089 --> 00:46:54,579
Go.

378
00:47:03,860 --> 00:47:05,450
Come on.

379
00:47:14,625 --> 00:47:17,695
He should wait for the day...

380
00:47:18,283 --> 00:47:21,683
I kill his wife and his tent.

381
00:48:46,869 --> 00:48:48,029
Come on.

382
00:49:12,020 --> 00:49:13,620
Come on.

383
00:49:14,043 --> 00:49:16,663
Our hunt won't be able to smell us.

384
00:49:17,008 --> 00:49:18,688
Come on.

385
00:50:02,165 --> 00:50:05,565
Stop, my Bey!

386
00:50:07,052 --> 00:50:10,032
Stop, my Bey!
Stop!

387
00:50:10,219 --> 00:50:12,279
Stop!

388
00:50:15,426 --> 00:50:18,206
What did you do, Kumral Abdal?

389
00:50:18,856 --> 00:50:20,946
It was wounded and desperate.

390
00:50:20,988 --> 00:50:23,218
Desperate?

391
00:50:25,530 --> 00:50:29,860
- It was in pain.
- Kumral Abdal...

392
00:50:30,201 --> 00:50:33,801
You wanted to hunt and now
you are wasting our time.

393
00:50:34,425 --> 00:50:36,775
I am sorry, my Bey.

394
00:50:37,218 --> 00:50:39,588
I am sorry.

395
00:50:42,873 --> 00:50:46,103
I don't want to cause...

396
00:50:46,581 --> 00:50:49,291
those gazelles' extinction.

397
00:50:53,291 --> 00:50:55,591
Are they hunted so much?

398
00:50:56,091 --> 00:50:58,661
It's nearly impossible to track them.

399
00:50:59,178 --> 00:51:04,308
Their ears and their eyes are strong.

400
00:51:04,719 --> 00:51:08,069
They can smell the hunters from
miles away.

401
00:51:08,787 --> 00:51:11,537
Hunting these gazelles...

402
00:51:12,011 --> 00:51:16,011
is only possible when a
good hunter like you does it.

403
00:51:16,791 --> 00:51:19,151
Then why are they becoming extinct?

404
00:51:19,920 --> 00:51:23,280
Female gazelles are sick now, my Bey.

405
00:51:28,120 --> 00:51:30,370
They are infertile.

406
00:51:32,623 --> 00:51:35,623
A child comes from Allah.

407
00:51:41,837 --> 00:51:44,827
A wound can't separate us...

408
00:51:45,039 --> 00:51:48,609
because we love each other so much.

409
00:51:50,177 --> 00:51:52,097
Osman.

410
00:51:55,241 --> 00:51:56,921
Don't.

411
00:51:58,018 --> 00:51:59,268
No.

412
00:52:00,832 --> 00:52:03,582
You will have children.

413
00:52:04,110 --> 00:52:07,660
- I won't do good for you.
- You won't do good for me?

414
00:52:07,710 --> 00:52:09,100
Bala.

415
00:52:09,329 --> 00:52:11,427
I fall apart without you.

416
00:52:12,227 --> 00:52:16,087
Being without you is the biggest
obstacle to my tomorrow.

417
00:52:19,448 --> 00:52:23,558
You are my power.

418
00:52:23,788 --> 00:52:27,788
You are my light.

419
00:52:29,307 --> 00:52:30,897
You...

420
00:52:32,310 --> 00:52:36,150
are my dream, you are my love.

421
00:52:39,507 --> 00:52:42,957
It's my biggest dream to marry you...

422
00:52:43,085 --> 00:52:46,575
and have the consent of my Sheikh.

423
00:52:53,253 --> 00:52:56,403
You are my love, Hatun.

424
00:52:59,640 --> 00:53:03,820
It is fine if Allah won't give us...

425
00:53:05,815 --> 00:53:07,805
children.

426
00:53:46,137 --> 00:53:50,097
They were wandering around as groups.

427
00:53:54,535 --> 00:53:56,595
Now they are very few.

428
00:53:57,645 --> 00:54:01,295
As the forests' beauty comes from them...

429
00:54:01,861 --> 00:54:07,921
our father Suleiman ibn
Qutalmish's descendants...

430
00:54:08,506 --> 00:54:11,026
called them the Sultan of the forest.

431
00:54:12,987 --> 00:54:16,987
They are dying out, my Bey.

432
00:54:18,610 --> 00:54:21,130
It is my bequest, Osman...

433
00:54:23,165 --> 00:54:24,885
My bequest...

434
00:54:59,777 --> 00:55:01,177
My bequest...

435
00:55:06,115 --> 00:55:11,415
These gazelles are the most beautiful
things the forest has ever seen.

436
00:55:13,223 --> 00:55:15,963
They are heroes.

437
00:55:16,016 --> 00:55:18,986
They protect themselves.

438
00:55:20,695 --> 00:55:24,245
They are living like a good memory now.

439
00:55:46,580 --> 00:55:49,890
Let's find ourselves another hunt.

440
00:55:50,317 --> 00:55:52,377
I will find you a new hunt.

441
00:55:52,642 --> 00:55:56,642
These mountains and the hills are my home.

442
00:55:58,063 --> 00:56:02,163
I missed here.
I missed here!

443
00:56:06,145 --> 00:56:07,395
Alps!

444
00:56:08,125 --> 00:56:10,255
Follow him.
He shouldn't be alone.

445
00:58:34,020 --> 00:58:35,920
Malhun Hatun?

446
00:58:48,155 --> 00:58:49,745
Malhun Hatun.

447
00:58:50,468 --> 00:58:52,658
What are you doing here?

448
00:59:09,370 --> 00:59:10,960
Bala.

449
00:59:22,092 --> 00:59:24,242
Bala.

450
00:59:28,095 --> 00:59:29,275
Bala.

451
00:59:59,956 --> 01:00:02,236
Help me, my Allah.

452
01:00:05,247 --> 01:00:07,007
Help me.

453
01:00:12,776 --> 01:00:16,486
My heart is a stake, my mind is a hammer.

454
01:00:19,410 --> 01:00:22,670
I am stuck between them.

455
01:00:23,119 --> 01:00:24,929
My Allah.

456
01:00:28,454 --> 01:00:30,694
Help me, my Allah.

457
01:00:31,908 --> 01:00:33,958
My Allah.

458
01:01:41,313 --> 01:01:43,543
I didn't hear you came, my Bey.

459
01:01:44,000 --> 01:01:45,700
Welcome.

460
01:01:50,572 --> 01:01:52,622
How was the hunt?

461
01:02:11,236 --> 01:02:13,736
The hunter and the gazelle...

462
01:02:20,026 --> 01:02:22,476
are an old story.

463
01:02:28,373 --> 01:02:30,513
He doesn't want to attack.

464
01:02:31,704 --> 01:02:33,874
However, he has to.

465
01:02:35,837 --> 01:02:38,607
You will if you have to, Osman Bey.

466
01:02:48,669 --> 01:02:51,609
Look at the gazelle's eyes...

467
01:02:52,697 --> 01:02:55,567
before you do.

468
01:03:18,227 --> 01:03:20,367
I made up my mind.

469
01:03:44,459 --> 01:03:46,569
Come here, my Bala.

470
01:03:47,102 --> 01:03:48,572
Come here.

471
01:04:01,344 --> 01:04:04,464
I will marry someone...

472
01:04:07,483 --> 01:04:10,313
to have an heir for Kayı Tent.

473
01:04:27,707 --> 01:04:30,467
It's a good decision, Osman Bey.

474
01:04:44,052 --> 01:04:45,742
Tell me.

475
01:04:46,232 --> 01:04:48,582
Do you have someone in your mind?

476
01:04:51,867 --> 01:04:53,697
Yes.

477
01:05:02,983 --> 01:05:04,873
However, you are in my heart.

478
01:05:08,266 --> 01:05:10,586
As for who I think of...

479
01:05:12,407 --> 01:05:15,577
it is Sheikh Edebalı's request as well.

480
01:05:19,967 --> 01:05:22,927
So, it is my father's request.

481
01:05:28,937 --> 01:05:30,807
My father.

482
01:05:32,719 --> 01:05:36,619
Who is she? Do I know her?

483
01:05:44,670 --> 01:05:47,080
Kızılbeyoğlu...

484
01:05:48,459 --> 01:05:51,069
Umur Bey's daughter...

485
01:05:52,612 --> 01:05:54,812
Malhun Hatun.

486
01:06:02,671 --> 01:06:04,341
Did my father...

487
01:06:05,359 --> 01:06:07,409
tell you this?

488
01:06:16,843 --> 01:06:17,963
Good.

489
01:06:29,128 --> 01:06:31,708
You made a decision.

490
01:06:32,491 --> 01:06:34,591
May it be good for you.

491
01:06:54,048 --> 01:06:56,568
She is noble.

492
01:06:57,229 --> 01:06:59,399
She is beautiful.

493
01:07:03,009 --> 01:07:05,449
She will be a good wife.

494
01:07:09,108 --> 01:07:11,338
She is good for you.

495
01:07:13,796 --> 01:07:16,386
She will give you children.

496
01:07:22,262 --> 01:07:24,642
The heir issue is over now.

497
01:07:26,497 --> 01:07:30,847
It is a decision to
reconcile the two tents.

498
01:07:36,867 --> 01:07:39,397
If you don't want me to...

499
01:07:43,996 --> 01:07:46,686
if you don't want Malhun Hatun...

500
01:07:48,098 --> 01:07:49,858
I will find someone else.

501
01:07:51,762 --> 01:07:53,612
Osman Bey.

502
01:07:54,419 --> 01:07:56,909
You say it is Sheikh Edebalı's request.

503
01:07:58,720 --> 01:08:00,960
He is my father.

504
01:08:01,499 --> 01:08:04,319
He knows me well.

505
01:08:07,138 --> 01:08:09,128
He knows what this decision...

506
01:08:10,002 --> 01:08:12,262
means to me.

507
01:08:22,014 --> 01:08:24,884
What can I say...

508
01:08:27,358 --> 01:08:29,747
if he told you to marry Malhun Hatun?

509
01:08:39,995 --> 01:08:41,725
You will marry her.

510
01:08:52,917 --> 01:08:55,377
Your decision is right.

511
01:08:56,689 --> 01:09:00,689
Malhun Hatun is a good wife for you.

512
01:09:05,710 --> 01:09:08,600
Ertuğrul Ghazi's bequest...

513
01:09:09,093 --> 01:09:12,313
and Sheikh Edebal's request should
be satisfied.

514
01:09:13,953 --> 01:09:16,604
The Kayı Tent should have an heir.

515
01:09:35,774 --> 01:09:38,163
If you excuse me.

516
01:09:39,252 --> 01:09:41,712
I want to be alone.

517
01:10:04,157 --> 01:10:06,547
I am going to meet Nikola.

518
01:10:06,600 --> 01:10:09,830
We couldn't attack Togay as we promised
we would.

519
01:10:09,933 --> 01:10:12,973
He should know we stick to our deal.

520
01:10:13,024 --> 01:10:16,554
Let me come with you.
Nikola must be very angry.

521
01:10:16,657 --> 01:10:20,267
No, no.
You should stay here.

522
01:10:20,982 --> 01:10:23,602
Watch Malhun Hatun.

523
01:10:23,658 --> 01:10:26,968
She shouldn't know I went to meet Nikola.

524
01:10:44,492 --> 01:10:46,072
- Boran.
- Yes, my Bey.

525
01:10:46,110 --> 01:10:48,550
Did you make up for
the losses of refugees?

526
01:10:48,782 --> 01:10:52,782
Yes, my Bey. They have places to stay...

527
01:10:52,885 --> 01:10:57,235
and everything to trade and sell.

528
01:11:04,851 --> 01:11:07,231
Tell Alps to have more guards.

529
01:11:07,335 --> 01:11:10,965
They should do what is
necessary if Yaso wants to take revenge.

530
01:11:11,047 --> 01:11:13,367
Your command, my Bey.

531
01:11:14,003 --> 01:11:17,663
- Salam Alaikum, my Bey.
- Alaikum Salam, brother.

532
01:11:18,690 --> 01:11:20,570
What do we have from Togay?

533
01:11:20,638 --> 01:11:25,218
He bragged when he heard our loyalty.

534
01:11:26,901 --> 01:11:30,901
Let him comfort himself
with his arrogance.

535
01:11:35,201 --> 01:11:37,431
Salam Alaikum.

536
01:11:38,807 --> 01:11:40,947
Alaikum Salam.

537
01:11:42,672 --> 01:11:45,892
Akça Dervish, you work like a beaver.

538
01:11:45,945 --> 01:11:49,945
We shouldn't stop, my Bey.
Do you ever stop?

539
01:11:50,176 --> 01:11:54,776
The world doesn't even stop.

540
01:11:57,048 --> 01:12:00,388
Our day is better as we have seen you.

541
01:12:00,524 --> 01:12:03,444
Thank you.

542
01:12:03,909 --> 01:12:07,909
- Is my Sheikh here?
- Yes, my Bey.

543
01:12:13,723 --> 01:12:17,723
- Salam Alaikum, my Sheikh.
- Alaikum Salam, Osman Bey.

544
01:12:23,219 --> 01:12:25,729
You made your decision.

545
01:12:30,575 --> 01:12:32,845
I made a decision, my Sheikh.

546
01:12:33,601 --> 01:12:35,481
If Umur Bey has consent...

547
01:12:36,713 --> 01:12:39,743
I want to tell him my intentions
about Malhun Hatun.

548
01:12:40,616 --> 01:12:43,896
You did what you had to do, Osman Bey.

549
01:12:44,036 --> 01:12:46,966
I will talk to Umur Bey.

550
01:12:50,068 --> 01:12:54,068
The hardest challenge
starts now, Osman Bey.

551
01:12:55,391 --> 01:13:00,221
Bala will learn to be patient.

552
01:13:01,943 --> 01:13:06,503
You will learn to make both
of the Hatuns happy...

553
01:13:06,717 --> 01:13:09,797
and not to make them upset.

554
01:13:13,330 --> 01:13:14,670
And...

555
01:13:15,259 --> 01:13:21,599
you will also take care of your tent.

556
01:13:26,618 --> 01:13:28,598
Pray for me, my Sheikh.

557
01:13:29,472 --> 01:13:34,452
My prayers are with you.
May Allah help you.

558
01:13:36,568 --> 01:13:38,098
Amin.

559
01:13:38,658 --> 01:13:40,758
If you excuse me.

560
01:13:42,929 --> 01:13:45,959
Alps! Come on.

561
01:13:46,696 --> 01:13:48,346
Akça Dervish.

562
01:13:51,154 --> 01:13:52,424
Yes, my Sheikh.

563
01:13:53,234 --> 01:13:55,214
Let Umur Bey know.

564
01:13:55,945 --> 01:13:59,995
- I will talk to him.
- I will take the road, my Sheikh.

565
01:14:09,162 --> 01:14:13,112
After your daughter's
betrayal, now it's you!

566
01:14:13,797 --> 01:14:17,277
I wonder what is your excuse.

567
01:14:18,121 --> 01:14:21,821
- Osman...
- Umur Bey, you even rose against Geyhatu!

568
01:14:21,859 --> 01:14:24,019
You even lost your children!

569
01:14:24,041 --> 01:14:27,371
You bow down to Osman now.

570
01:14:31,451 --> 01:14:33,171
Ah, Umur Bey.

571
01:14:34,713 --> 01:14:36,023
Nikola.

572
01:14:37,353 --> 01:14:40,133
Know your place!

573
01:14:40,572 --> 01:14:43,442
Osman obviously made you do it.

574
01:14:44,905 --> 01:14:46,075
Umur Bey.

575
01:14:46,166 --> 01:14:49,256
You obeyed Osman...

576
01:14:49,339 --> 01:14:52,019
for a little land.

577
01:14:52,491 --> 01:14:54,501
What did he do?

578
01:14:54,557 --> 01:14:59,867
He tied your hands
against your biggest enemy!

579
01:15:00,433 --> 01:15:01,663
Nikola!

580
01:15:01,734 --> 01:15:04,084
Now that he has khilat...

581
01:15:04,138 --> 01:15:08,138
who can hold him?

582
01:15:10,702 --> 01:15:12,872
What will you do?

583
01:15:13,526 --> 01:15:17,736
You will bow down to...

584
01:15:18,179 --> 01:15:19,969
your new Sultan.

585
01:15:20,379 --> 01:15:23,559
Enough!
Enough, Nikola!

586
01:15:23,927 --> 01:15:27,147
I am not done with Togay yet.

587
01:15:27,652 --> 01:15:29,766
What do you mean?

588
01:15:30,766 --> 01:15:34,336
I won't get permission from neither
Osman nor Sultan and Geyhatu...

589
01:15:34,704 --> 01:15:38,684
to cut my enemy's head off.

590
01:15:40,854 --> 01:15:44,974
I am here to talk about this.

591
01:15:46,005 --> 01:15:50,005
If you are still brave...

592
01:15:52,027 --> 01:15:56,207
I want you to know that I
am ready to attack Togay.

593
01:15:57,669 --> 01:16:00,679
We can talk about this Umur Bey but...

594
01:16:01,904 --> 01:16:07,684
how can I be sure of you
won't betray me again?

595
01:16:08,077 --> 01:16:11,447
I set my mind on it!

596
01:16:11,550 --> 01:16:14,270
I want Togay's head.

597
01:16:14,360 --> 01:16:18,360
With you or without you.

598
01:16:20,355 --> 01:16:21,865
Then...

599
01:16:43,045 --> 01:16:46,445
We should go to Söğüt, Gonca.

600
01:16:46,551 --> 01:16:48,701
Whenever you want, my Bala.

601
01:16:49,026 --> 01:16:53,116
We will ask for a girl in marriage.
We have some things to get.

602
01:16:53,216 --> 01:16:57,396
- Who will we ask for, my Bala?
- Malhun Hatun.

603
01:16:57,932 --> 01:16:59,612
Malhun Hatun?

604
01:17:06,732 --> 01:17:08,392
For who?

605
01:17:11,065 --> 01:17:13,375
For Osman Bey.

606
01:17:15,087 --> 01:17:16,887
Osman Bey?

607
01:17:18,774 --> 01:17:21,004
What are you talking about, my Bala?

608
01:17:21,866 --> 01:17:24,216
You heard me, Gonca.

609
01:17:27,439 --> 01:17:29,919
Why is it her?

610
01:17:30,007 --> 01:17:31,887
Why is it Malhun Hatun?

611
01:17:33,252 --> 01:17:36,172
Doesn't Osman Bey know you don't like her?

612
01:17:41,323 --> 01:17:43,873
It is what my Sheikh wants.

613
01:17:44,826 --> 01:17:46,846
Is it?

614
01:18:00,255 --> 01:18:01,835
My Bala.

615
01:18:08,850 --> 01:18:12,620
- Salam Alaikum, my Sheikh.
- Alaikum Salam

616
01:18:12,747 --> 01:18:15,277
I had an important thing to do
in İnegöl but...

617
01:18:15,317 --> 01:18:19,273
I hurried up here when I heard
my Sheikh wants to talk to me.

618
01:18:19,453 --> 01:18:23,233
What happened?
Is it something important?

619
01:18:23,809 --> 01:18:27,359
It is, Umur Bey.

620
01:18:29,538 --> 01:18:34,078
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim. (In the name of Allah, the Most Gracious, the Most Merciful)

621
01:18:34,837 --> 01:18:38,107
As I said before...

622
01:18:38,891 --> 01:18:43,991
the hostility between the
two Turkmen Beys...

623
01:18:44,262 --> 01:18:46,222
isn't right.

624
01:18:46,991 --> 01:18:49,811
What has to be done is obvious...

625
01:18:50,176 --> 01:18:55,796
to end the hostility and...

626
01:18:56,023 --> 01:18:58,333
to make the two tents closer.

627
01:19:02,342 --> 01:19:04,062
A marriage.

628
01:19:09,392 --> 01:19:15,072
I think the marriage between Osman Bey and
your daughter Malhun Hatun...

629
01:19:16,334 --> 01:19:19,094
will make it happen.

630
01:19:28,719 --> 01:19:35,199
It is you who will decide, Umur Bey.

631
01:19:36,860 --> 01:19:39,840
I am sure you will make the best decision.

632
01:19:42,806 --> 01:19:44,336
My Sheikh...

633
01:19:45,676 --> 01:19:47,166
all of a sudden...

634
01:19:47,792 --> 01:19:50,482
please...

635
01:19:52,502 --> 01:19:57,312
excuse my confusion, my Sheikh.

636
01:20:02,994 --> 01:20:06,984
Whenever you need us, we are ready.

637
01:20:09,976 --> 01:20:13,066
Thank you.

638
01:20:24,216 --> 01:20:30,596
It's appropriate for Osman Bey
to personally come, my sheik.

639
01:20:31,046 --> 01:20:36,156
-I'll be honored to host you.
-Not at all.

640
01:20:36,156 --> 01:20:40,156
Inshallah, we'll come with Osman Bey.

641
01:20:40,349 --> 01:20:44,049
As you want, my sheik.

642
01:20:44,049 --> 01:20:48,599
Now, if you allow me, my sheik.

643
01:20:48,599 --> 01:20:51,609
Go on, Umur Bey.

644
01:20:53,517 --> 01:20:55,777
Thank you.

645
01:21:09,318 --> 01:21:14,798
If you don't want Malhun Hatun, then
I'll find someone else.

646
01:21:15,447 --> 01:21:19,447
Osman Bey, you say that it's
Sheik Edebali's wish.

647
01:21:21,036 --> 01:21:26,876
He is my father. He knows my heart
the best.

648
01:21:28,435 --> 01:21:34,435
He knows best what this decision
means for me.

649
01:21:39,890 --> 01:21:43,890
If he told you to marry Malhun Hatun...

650
01:21:45,302 --> 01:21:48,362
what can I say?

651
01:21:48,362 --> 01:21:53,842
Bala will grin and bear it.
She'll learn to be patient.

652
01:21:59,754 --> 01:22:03,574
Our bey is worried, brother.

653
01:22:04,148 --> 01:22:08,148
It seems that he has troubles, Boran.

654
01:22:09,096 --> 01:22:13,376
He is like this ever since he was with
Sheik Edebali.

655
01:22:14,074 --> 01:22:18,074
They talked privately when we stopped
Umur Bey.

656
01:22:18,631 --> 01:22:22,631
It's about Umur Bey, it seems.

657
01:22:22,837 --> 01:22:26,477
We'll know tomorrow.

658
01:22:30,222 --> 01:22:34,222
-Come on, brother.
-Come on, brother.

659
01:23:04,841 --> 01:23:08,841
Osman Bey, you know...

660
01:23:08,841 --> 01:23:12,841
two grooms is equal to one treat,
they say.

661
01:23:14,190 --> 01:23:18,320
-How is your hand, Bamsı Bey?
-My hand is fine.

662
01:23:18,320 --> 01:23:22,320
It's better. Mashallah.

663
01:23:25,450 --> 01:23:31,610
Osman Bey, it seems like you made that
difficult decision.

664
01:23:37,007 --> 01:23:41,337
I've talked to my sheik.
If Umur Bey accepts it...

665
01:23:42,618 --> 01:23:46,618
-I will marry Malhun Hatun.
-Good.

666
01:23:46,618 --> 01:23:50,618
It was difficult but it's good.

667
01:23:50,618 --> 01:23:55,678
Umur Bey will understand that this is
the best. It's good.

668
01:23:55,985 --> 01:23:59,985
Inshallah. Inshallah.

669
01:24:00,704 --> 01:24:04,014
Inshallah.

670
01:24:08,665 --> 01:24:11,995
Karayel...

671
01:24:12,754 --> 01:24:15,574
Karayel...

672
01:24:23,415 --> 01:24:27,035
Bala Hatun, look at this.

673
01:24:33,011 --> 01:24:37,761
This is so pretty, Bala Hatun.
We should make one for you too.

674
01:24:38,127 --> 01:24:42,467
-I have the same, hatun.
-I'll bring another, Bala Hatun.

675
01:24:45,630 --> 01:24:49,630
Bala Hatun, how is this?

676
01:24:55,715 --> 01:24:59,715
With the name of Allah!

677
01:25:46,190 --> 01:25:50,670
Bala. My pretty Bala.

678
01:25:50,670 --> 01:25:55,280
We can leave if you like.
The women can take care of it.

679
01:25:56,272 --> 01:26:01,732
What are you saying, Gonca Hatun?
It's our bey's wedding.

680
01:26:10,217 --> 01:26:17,257
Haven't I told you that I'll have Osman Bey
married with my own hands if I need to?

681
01:26:18,809 --> 01:26:22,809
-You have.
-Haven't I told you that our happiness...

682
01:26:22,809 --> 01:26:26,809
isn't more important than the future
of the state we are founding.

683
01:26:28,697 --> 01:26:33,707
-You have, Bala. You have.
-Then, don't make me sad.

684
01:26:35,354 --> 01:26:40,224
The gifts will be prepared.
Come on.

685
01:26:41,140 --> 01:26:47,370
Choose the best of the fabrics.
Come on.

686
01:26:48,343 --> 01:26:51,043
Come on.

687
01:26:59,718 --> 01:27:04,518
Malik is a name of Allah.

688
01:27:04,613 --> 01:27:08,613
The meaning of this name is that...

689
01:27:08,613 --> 01:27:14,563
we aren't the malik, the owner,
of anything.

690
01:27:16,088 --> 01:27:20,088
But the wordly affairs...

691
01:27:20,088 --> 01:27:24,088
make us forget that.

692
01:27:24,088 --> 01:27:28,508
We think that we are the owners of
the escrows.

693
01:27:32,193 --> 01:27:37,933
With staff on your hand, you wander
around mountains, Kumral Abdal.

694
01:27:39,499 --> 01:27:43,499
Don't you have anything.

695
01:27:46,348 --> 01:27:53,138
I handed over the escrows before
Allah wanted me to.

696
01:27:56,306 --> 01:28:02,446
This is the meaning of the verse that say
''Die before dying.''

697
01:28:02,965 --> 01:28:06,965
Even our lives are escrows.

698
01:28:06,965 --> 01:28:11,385
This is the path of those who can
give up on their lives.

699
01:28:14,480 --> 01:28:19,030
What's more difficult than giving
up on your lives?

700
01:28:19,177 --> 01:28:23,177
My sheik knows.

701
01:28:23,177 --> 01:28:26,417
Tell us, my sheik.

702
01:28:35,897 --> 01:28:39,897
Giving up on your loved one.

703
01:28:45,333 --> 01:28:49,333
With the name of Allah.

704
01:29:01,228 --> 01:29:06,898
Come, my love, my loved one.
My pretty daughter. Come.

705
01:29:21,588 --> 01:29:26,258
O' the one who has to give up
on her loved one.

706
01:29:27,067 --> 01:29:31,067
May Allah give you patience.

707
01:29:31,291 --> 01:29:37,951
My sheik, my heart is in fire.

708
01:29:44,157 --> 01:29:50,597
Those who are cleansed from the
dirt of this world...

709
01:29:50,842 --> 01:29:55,862
are the ones whose hearts are
in fire.

710
01:29:58,970 --> 01:30:04,580
Without that fire, eyes can't
get wet.

711
01:30:06,701 --> 01:30:11,741
If those tears don't trop
from those eyes...

712
01:30:14,730 --> 01:30:18,730
the sins can't get washed.

713
01:30:21,316 --> 01:30:25,316
How many sins do I have, my sheik?

714
01:30:25,316 --> 01:30:29,316
I keep crying but I can't
find a cure.

715
01:30:31,206 --> 01:30:35,206
Come.
Come.

716
01:30:56,203 --> 01:30:59,643
Father...

717
01:31:00,303 --> 01:31:04,303
Father...

718
01:31:28,201 --> 01:31:33,221
-May I enter, my bey?
-Come in.

719
01:31:41,784 --> 01:31:46,654
-Do you have any order, my bey?
-No.

720
01:31:51,852 --> 01:31:57,592
Merchants from the east came but couldn't
find you. The alps told me.

721
01:32:03,419 --> 01:32:07,419
I've talked to the merchants.

722
01:32:23,581 --> 01:32:27,911
To put an end to this animosity...

723
01:32:27,911 --> 01:32:33,060
and make the two tribes have
closer connections...

724
01:32:33,703 --> 01:32:38,423
what must be done is certain.
A marriage.

725
01:32:51,322 --> 01:32:55,322
My bey, are you alright?

726
01:32:56,077 --> 01:32:59,527
I'm fine.

727
01:33:01,808 --> 01:33:05,808
Where did you go today?
I was worried.

728
01:33:15,017 --> 01:33:19,017
If you allow me.

729
01:33:40,582 --> 01:33:46,242
If Umur Bey betrays you this time,
it won't end well. We'll face Togay.

730
01:33:47,117 --> 01:33:51,587
No one will stop me this time.

731
01:33:51,725 --> 01:33:57,965
At the entrance of the Raven Valley,
a forest.

732
01:33:57,965 --> 01:34:01,965
When I went to meet
Togay, we found out...

733
01:34:01,965 --> 01:34:05,965
the placements of all his warriors.

734
01:34:05,965 --> 01:34:09,965
According to the intel I got from
my spies...

735
01:34:10,803 --> 01:34:15,933
The passages, the numbers of his
warriors...

736
01:34:15,933 --> 01:34:19,933
their supplies, the traps they've
set against raid...

737
01:34:19,933 --> 01:34:25,773
we pointed them all out on
this map.

738
01:34:26,842 --> 01:34:31,632
Umur Bey, I will be waiting for you
with my soldiers...

739
01:34:31,632 --> 01:34:36,754
at the passage to the valley, before
the water fall.

740
01:34:36,893 --> 01:34:40,893
From the skirts of the hill
to the valley...

741
01:34:40,893 --> 01:34:44,893
at a moment Togay expects the least...

742
01:34:44,893 --> 01:34:48,893
we'll attack his quarters.

743
01:34:49,163 --> 01:34:53,163
What do you say, Umur Bey?

744
01:34:53,531 --> 01:34:58,651
If you are speaking the truth...

745
01:34:58,651 --> 01:35:03,821
this will be easier than I thought.

746
01:35:04,919 --> 01:35:08,919
How soon can you prepare your
soldiers?

747
01:35:08,919 --> 01:35:13,819
If your soldiers are ready,
so are my alps!

748
01:35:13,819 --> 01:35:18,149
-Let's end this tomorrow.
-This soon?

749
01:35:18,149 --> 01:35:23,779
Like branding a wound, swiftly.

750
01:35:33,677 --> 01:35:37,677
What will we do when Umur
gets in the trap?

751
01:35:37,677 --> 01:35:41,037
Then, my military brilliance
will be at play.

752
01:35:41,037 --> 01:35:45,677
-What kind of an attack is in your mind?
-I will go alone.

753
01:35:46,007 --> 01:35:50,227
I will face Togay all alone.

754
01:35:50,227 --> 01:35:54,667
-What are you saying, sir?
-I will face him and say...

755
01:35:54,667 --> 01:35:58,667
Umur Bey will attack you with
his alps.

756
01:35:58,667 --> 01:36:04,197
If Togay knows that Umur's attack
was known by Osman, what happens?

757
01:36:08,296 --> 01:36:13,856
You will make your enemies kill each
other without losing a soldier.

758
01:36:17,910 --> 01:36:21,910
I'll go meet Togay.

759
01:36:23,204 --> 01:36:27,204
Maybe we can break some ice too.

760
01:37:57,015 --> 01:38:01,735
We are grateful for the good.
We seek your protection against the bad.

761
01:38:01,735 --> 01:38:04,725
We are consent with our fates.

762
01:38:05,557 --> 01:38:09,787
Bless the decision that Osman Bey
made...

763
01:38:09,787 --> 01:38:14,502
for his tribe's future, after his father's
will.

764
01:38:18,532 --> 01:38:23,822
My holy Allah, we are consent with
our fates.

765
01:38:24,821 --> 01:38:29,731
We accept anything that
comes from you.

766
01:38:30,273 --> 01:38:34,273
Helps us to get out of
this dark well..

767
01:38:34,273 --> 01:38:38,273
that we fell into with
my wife.

768
01:38:39,993 --> 01:38:43,993
Make Osman Bey have children...

769
01:38:43,993 --> 01:38:48,793
a lineage that will last forever.

770
01:38:48,793 --> 01:38:52,793
We seek your protection, my Allah.

771
01:38:52,793 --> 01:38:56,793
Don't break our unity, my Allah.

772
01:38:58,490 --> 01:39:03,770
-Amin.
-Amin.

773
01:39:07,164 --> 01:39:10,854
May Allah accept, my bey.

774
01:39:12,844 --> 01:39:17,934
Amin, Bala.
Amin.

775
01:39:22,152 --> 01:39:27,972
Umur Bey sent news.

776
01:39:32,468 --> 01:39:35,358
Tomorrow...

777
01:39:37,365 --> 01:39:41,365
we'll go to him with my sheik.

778
01:39:48,386 --> 01:39:52,386
May the outcome be the best, my bey.

779
01:40:00,586 --> 01:40:05,226
-Amin.
-Amin.

780
01:42:48,176 --> 01:42:52,176
May Allah accept, my bey.

781
01:42:52,401 --> 01:42:58,911
Cerkutay, you don't forget what you
hear. Mashallah.

782
01:42:59,382 --> 01:43:04,632
May Allah accept all our prayers, son.

783
01:43:06,861 --> 01:43:10,861
May Allah accept all our prayers,
Bamsı Bey.

784
01:43:11,315 --> 01:43:15,315
Patience, Allah.

785
01:43:18,099 --> 01:43:23,369
-May I enter, my bey?
-Come, my child.

786
01:43:30,011 --> 01:43:34,011
Come, come.

787
01:43:41,079 --> 01:43:45,079
May Allah accept.

788
01:43:47,551 --> 01:43:51,551
May Allah accept all our prayers.

789
01:43:53,382 --> 01:43:57,382
Patience, Allah.

790
01:44:02,616 --> 01:44:09,586
-Cerkutay forgot to bring your food.
-Thank you, my child. Thank you.

791
01:44:10,391 --> 01:44:14,391
So, Cerkutay. You don't leave yourself
hungry but...

792
01:44:14,391 --> 01:44:18,391
you leave Bamsı Bey hungry.
-My bey...

793
01:44:18,601 --> 01:44:25,541
when you said we were going to perform
salaat, I forgot it with the excitement.

794
01:44:25,867 --> 01:44:29,537
Mashallah, did you forget to eat
because of the salaat?

795
01:44:29,537 --> 01:44:33,867
No, I ate. I forgot to bring
Bamsı Bey's.

796
01:44:47,528 --> 01:44:52,738
-I should leave, Bamsı Bey.
-Thank you, daughter. See you.

797
01:44:59,678 --> 01:45:04,328
Thank you. See you.

798
01:45:09,451 --> 01:45:14,931
Son, now, you are a Muslim.

799
01:45:14,931 --> 01:45:20,351
Now, we should find you a nice
girl to marry.

800
01:45:20,545 --> 01:45:25,565
My bey, don't worry.
I found one.

801
01:45:26,187 --> 01:45:30,187
-You did?
-I did, my bey.

802
01:45:32,139 --> 01:45:35,139
-Cerkutay.
-Yes.

803
01:45:35,139 --> 01:45:41,169
You must've found an inappropriate match.
Leave it to the elders.

804
01:45:42,486 --> 01:45:46,486
My bey, my bey, my bey.

805
01:45:48,842 --> 01:45:53,922
If we should leave this to the elders.

806
01:45:54,969 --> 01:46:00,619
My heart is on my right.
Take it out, my bey.

807
01:46:10,831 --> 01:46:13,831
My bey.

808
01:46:25,452 --> 01:46:28,062
Erlik Khan!

809
01:46:28,064 --> 01:46:32,064
Send your dark spirits...

810
01:46:32,615 --> 01:46:39,265
the day of vengeance is coming...

811
01:46:40,459 --> 01:46:45,289
the smell of blood is wrapping the
whole world...

812
01:46:45,778 --> 01:46:51,338
may the soil be fed with blood...

813
01:46:52,097 --> 01:46:56,447
may our swords spread death...

814
01:46:57,584 --> 01:47:06,214
may our fire of vengeance burn all
our enemies...

815
01:47:06,350 --> 01:47:09,530
the power of the spirits...

816
01:47:09,530 --> 01:47:13,530
is with Togay the Dark Shaman!

817
01:47:42,125 --> 01:47:44,545
Silence!

818
01:47:48,838 --> 01:47:53,798
You better not tire your soldiers
like this.

819
01:47:53,798 --> 01:47:59,478
They should have the strength to fight
like men.

820
01:48:01,588 --> 01:48:06,988
Umur will visit you soon like
a nightmare.

821
01:48:10,252 --> 01:48:25,351
Tss, tss, tss, tss!

822
01:48:30,664 --> 01:48:35,174
I told you that Osman would betray you,
but you didn't listen!

823
01:48:35,174 --> 01:48:38,424
You will see the result soon.

824
01:48:40,930 --> 01:48:46,600
Your tongue spills poison.

825
01:48:46,873 --> 01:48:52,843
Umur and his alps are morning training
for you. My concern is Osman.

826
01:48:52,843 --> 01:48:58,533
Do you think he would dare to do this
without asking him?

827
01:48:59,973 --> 01:49:03,973
Praeteritum praeteritum.

828
01:49:03,973 --> 01:49:07,973
The past is in the past.

829
01:49:15,219 --> 01:49:19,219
I'm extending an olive branch.

830
01:49:19,407 --> 01:49:24,167
If my information is wrong...

831
01:49:24,167 --> 01:49:28,167
I'm ready to pay the price.

832
01:49:30,546 --> 01:49:34,546
But what if I'm right?

833
01:49:35,595 --> 01:49:39,595
What do you know?
Speak!

834
01:49:39,595 --> 01:49:44,545
Umur learned your position...

835
01:49:45,265 --> 01:49:48,395
from Osman.

836
01:49:48,947 --> 01:49:54,427
They'll come here from the skirts
of the hill.

837
01:49:54,427 --> 01:49:59,127
-How did you learn?
-I don't have a spy at Osman's tribe now.

838
01:49:59,192 --> 01:50:03,192
But I have some at Umur Bey's tribe.

839
01:50:05,150 --> 01:50:09,150
You can't even imagine.

840
01:50:10,700 --> 01:50:14,700
Geyhatu's hunting dog...

841
01:50:14,700 --> 01:50:20,370
Togay the Dark Shaman. I wish
you good hunt.

842
01:50:32,258 --> 01:50:37,548
Camuha, prepare the warriors.

843
01:50:37,548 --> 01:50:42,518
It's time for blood.

844
01:50:45,172 --> 01:50:49,172
Hurry! Hurry!

845
01:50:49,172 --> 01:50:53,172
It's time for blood!

846
01:51:25,926 --> 01:51:32,146
-Boran, have you helped the refugees?
-We have, my bey.

847
01:51:32,146 --> 01:51:37,666
All their needs from shelter to
food will be provided.

848
01:51:37,666 --> 01:51:41,926
-They look happy, Osman Bey.
-They'll have a home.

849
01:51:42,325 --> 01:51:47,415
They'll work and live.
They have right to be happy.

850
01:51:47,933 --> 01:51:52,743
Who knows how they suffered in
Yasu's hands.

851
01:51:56,853 --> 01:52:00,853
-Salam Alaikum!
-Welcome, my bey.

852
01:52:00,853 --> 01:52:04,853
Come, come, come!

853
01:52:06,026 --> 01:52:11,216
Now it's time. A new life
is beginning for you.

854
01:52:11,537 --> 01:52:15,537
-With Allah's approval, inshallah.
-Thank you, Osman Bey.

855
01:52:15,537 --> 01:52:20,327
-We owe you gratitude for what you did.
-Not at all. Not at all.

856
01:52:20,450 --> 01:52:24,450
-May God protect you, Osman Bey.
-Thank you. You too.

857
01:52:24,653 --> 01:52:29,433
You've seen hostility but shown
friendship.

858
01:52:29,433 --> 01:52:34,873
Despite Dimos' betrayal, despite us
having a traitor among us, you were good.

859
01:52:35,169 --> 01:52:39,779
-May God protect you, Osman Bey.
-Us all. Us all.

860
01:53:00,316 --> 01:53:05,166
We all have a part on the making
of this.

861
01:53:05,166 --> 01:53:09,166
You treated us like a friend, not a bey.

862
01:53:09,166 --> 01:53:13,556
May God protect you, Osman Bey.
May your future be bright.

863
01:53:13,981 --> 01:53:17,981
Thank you. But this isn't a farewell.

864
01:53:17,981 --> 01:53:21,981
Söğüt is our land just like Kayı Tribe.

865
01:53:21,981 --> 01:53:27,331
And you will live under my banner
with peace.

866
01:53:27,331 --> 01:53:31,921
Thank you, Osman Bey.
Thank you, Osman Bey.

867
01:53:36,842 --> 01:53:42,602
Thank you, thank you. Alps, help
them carry their stuffs.

868
01:53:42,602 --> 01:53:46,602
-They should be on their way at once.
-Alright, my bey.

869
01:53:52,360 --> 01:53:56,360
These are the signs of the state you
will found, Osman Bey.

870
01:53:56,360 --> 01:54:00,360
I already see it. All the oppressed
people...

871
01:54:00,360 --> 01:54:06,330
find shelter under your banner.
-Inshallah, brother.

872
01:54:07,052 --> 01:54:12,572
We need to go to Umur Bey's tribe.
No good will come from delaying it.

873
01:54:12,572 --> 01:54:16,572
-Prepare the alps.
-As you order, my bey.

874
01:54:19,898 --> 01:54:23,898
-Osman Bey.
-Tell me, brother.

875
01:54:24,961 --> 01:54:29,771
If you allow it, I want to speak to my
brother, not to my bey.

876
01:54:31,088 --> 01:54:36,048
-Tell me, brother.
-It's hard.

877
01:54:36,256 --> 01:54:40,886
It's hard to make your loved one
sad knowingly.

878
01:54:41,500 --> 01:54:46,100
I know that your heart is full
of affection. But don't forget...

879
01:54:46,100 --> 01:54:50,100
Bala Hatun is our precious.

880
01:54:50,100 --> 01:54:54,700
She is the Head Hatun of our tribe
and the pole of our tent.

881
01:54:54,965 --> 01:54:59,385
This will always stay that way.
Be at ease.

882
01:54:59,385 --> 01:55:04,785
Brother, you did the right thing.

883
01:55:52,340 --> 01:55:54,550
Bala.

884
01:55:56,865 --> 01:56:01,135
We've done the preparations as it
fits our tribe, my bey.

885
01:56:07,944 --> 01:56:12,844
You have my blessing.
May Allah bless you too.

886
01:56:16,430 --> 01:56:20,430
-Do you want to see the gifts.
-Bala...

887
01:56:20,651 --> 01:56:24,651
I want to look at you.

888
01:56:24,651 --> 01:56:28,651
Let the gifts be looked
by the receiver.

889
01:56:28,651 --> 01:56:32,651
I want to see the gift
that Allah gave to me.

890
01:56:34,269 --> 01:56:38,269
She will give you children...

891
01:56:39,759 --> 01:56:41,939
it's great.

892
01:56:47,243 --> 01:56:51,243
You can be on your way when
you want, my bey.

893
01:56:51,243 --> 01:56:55,243
You have the deepest place
in my heart.

894
01:56:55,243 --> 01:56:59,243
Even if they make the strongest
sword of the world...

895
01:56:59,509 --> 01:57:05,309
and pierce my heart, they can never
take you out of there.

896
01:57:06,333 --> 01:57:09,633
Never.

897
01:57:18,028 --> 01:57:23,098
I know, Osman Bey.
You have my blessing.

898
01:57:38,785 --> 01:57:42,425
Then, let's go.

899
01:57:53,131 --> 01:57:56,391
Alps!

900
01:58:08,222 --> 01:58:11,282
Take it.

901
01:58:23,400 --> 01:58:28,510
-Where is, Sheik Edebali.
-Our sheik will join us at Söğüt.

902
01:58:28,510 --> 01:58:30,050
Osman Bey.

903
01:58:32,665 --> 01:58:35,665
Is she well?

904
01:58:39,613 --> 01:58:44,063
May Allah bless her.
She is a brave woman.

905
01:58:54,368 --> 01:58:59,678
-Osman Bey, let's go.
-Let's go.

906
01:59:43,381 --> 01:59:49,531
-My heart is burning, Bala.
-You should go now, dark-eyed-one.

907
02:00:53,431 --> 02:00:58,831
Bala, come on. Come on.

908
02:01:46,178 --> 02:01:52,448
Wait, wait! Leave it to me.
Leave it to me.

909
02:01:53,658 --> 02:01:56,568
Leave it.

910
02:02:03,452 --> 02:02:07,452
Is this chest within your means,
guys?

911
02:02:12,726 --> 02:02:16,726
You will fall under it.

912
02:02:19,343 --> 02:02:21,863
Come on.

913
02:03:19,493 --> 02:03:22,243
Let me help.

914
02:03:31,941 --> 02:03:35,941
The apples are from Karacahisar.

915
02:03:37,509 --> 02:03:41,509
But the cart is from Bilecik.

916
02:03:41,535 --> 02:03:45,535
How do you know?

917
02:03:50,340 --> 02:03:54,850
The smell of Bilecik grape is on
the apples.

918
02:04:01,424 --> 02:04:06,184
Do you keep every smell
in your mind?

919
02:04:11,248 --> 02:04:15,798
Tell me your name, so that I can
keep it in my mind.

920
02:04:16,108 --> 02:04:20,108
I don't easily forget.

921
02:04:23,759 --> 02:04:28,749
Göktuğ Alp, you forgot us.

922
02:04:34,958 --> 02:04:40,268
-I need to go.
-Zoe.

923
02:04:42,130 --> 02:04:46,130
A name that you will forget.

924
02:04:52,884 --> 02:04:55,604
Alps.

925
02:04:59,089 --> 02:05:03,089
Help her too.

926
02:05:35,428 --> 02:05:39,428
-Malhun Hatun.
-Have you seen Bahadır Bey?

927
02:05:39,428 --> 02:05:43,428
He and Umur Bey took the alps
and left the tribe.

928
02:05:45,185 --> 02:05:50,145
-Where did they go?
-I don't know, Alaca.

929
02:05:50,502 --> 02:05:54,502
We will find out.

930
02:06:33,974 --> 02:06:37,974
Nikola was right this time.

931
02:06:43,269 --> 02:06:47,269
We are close to Togay's forest.

932
02:06:48,639 --> 02:06:53,479
Nikola must be close. Let's unmount.

933
02:06:53,479 --> 02:06:58,279
We'll sneak into Togay's place.

934
02:07:10,949 --> 02:07:14,909
For the bloody soil.

935
02:07:49,544 --> 02:07:53,544
It's Osman Bey.
What's that?

936
02:07:59,570 --> 02:08:05,630
My sheik, where is Umur Bey?

937
02:08:06,318 --> 02:08:10,318
Apparently, not in the tribe.

938
02:08:11,992 --> 02:08:15,992
What is this?

939
02:08:15,992 --> 02:08:19,992
With the name of Allah.

940
02:08:25,843 --> 02:08:31,603
Welcome. My sheik, you brought
honor.

941
02:08:33,115 --> 02:08:37,115
Come, let's get to the tribe.

942
02:09:46,633 --> 02:09:50,633
A handicraft.

943
02:09:50,776 --> 02:09:57,086
I thought about their love and
find comfort in my death bed.

944
02:10:00,186 --> 02:10:07,066
If I turn into ash like Aslı,
I will die happy.

945
02:10:07,794 --> 02:10:14,214
You are in my life. I won't let you
leave again, Bala Hatun.

946
02:10:21,308 --> 02:10:25,308
If you say so...

947
02:10:28,265 --> 02:10:32,265
ask my father, Osman Bey.

948
02:10:53,491 --> 02:10:59,421
If you allow it, then...

949
02:10:59,421 --> 02:11:02,211
I will tell my father when
he returns.

950
02:11:55,725 --> 02:11:58,405
Thank you, daughter.

951
02:12:03,234 --> 02:12:06,194
Thank you.

952
02:12:18,470 --> 02:12:25,040
-Where is Umur Bey, Malhun Hatun.
-Not at the tribe, Osman Bey. He left.

953
02:12:30,372 --> 02:12:35,702
-Where did he go?
-I don't know, Osman Bey.

954
02:12:43,094 --> 02:12:48,224
Daughter, Umur Bey knew that
we would come.

955
02:12:48,224 --> 02:12:52,224
He was supposed to wait for us.

956
02:12:58,199 --> 02:13:02,199
My sheik, what are those?

957
02:13:11,516 --> 02:13:15,516
Didn't Umur Bey tell you anything?

958
02:13:15,516 --> 02:13:18,266
He didn't, my sheik.

959
02:13:35,123 --> 02:13:39,123
We are here for good deeds.